  "title": "What an SEO specialist should do beyond rankings | Fyntix",
  "description": "Look for useful work across technical foundations, intent research, page improvements, implementation and business-aware reporting.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
